    "actions": [],
    "description": "<p>The SGRD-Ra3ap “Wrath” Powered Armor is a fairly heavy and durable ceramoalloy-plated powered armor, with strength and Item Slots to spare. Equipped with some life support and environmental protection, similar to Pioneer Armor.<br><br>Grants resilience to all types of damage, particularly Physical and ranged weapon damage, grants +10 Base ATK, and +15 DEF and SPDEF, increases the Physical damage the user deals, reduces the user's SPD by -15%, provides +15% RES, and grants +2 Belt Slots.<br><br>As well, whenver the user is hit by a Critical Hit, they are @Affliction[delay 30], have a 20% chance of losing @Tick[-1], and have a 50% chance of losing -1 ATK and SPD Stages for 3 Activations.</p>",
